76
00:09:45,610 --> 00:09:56,210
No one did reach the same level as before. They continued to go down. And the most important thing is that they stabilized below the previous level.

77
00:09:56,370 --> 00:10:01,530
They stabilized below the previous levels of anxiety when he followed these participants

78
00:10:02,410 --> 00:10:05,270
over a longer period of time, up to a year.

